{"guide":{"questionsToConsider":["Will you show this inside the app, or send the link by email or push notification? In-app reaches active users, email reaches the ones who drifted away.","Do you already know the app version and device from your analytics, or do you need to ask?","Which problems in the checklist are ones you've seen in crash reports, and which are you guessing at?","What will you give beta testers in return, and how many can your team actually support?"],"howToUseResponses":"Read the main tasks first and group them: the top few are what the app is really for, whatever the roadmap says. Compare ease scores across those groups to see which job is hardest. Pass every problem description to engineering with the platform attached, since a crash reported only on Android points somewhere very different from one on both. Invite the beta list before your next release.","customizeSteps":["Rename the rows in the rating grid to the parts of your app people actually use, such as search, checkout or messages.","Edit the problem list to match what shows up in your support tickets and crash reports.","Share the link inside the app after someone completes a key task, or email it to users who haven't opened the app in a while."],"faqs":[{"q":"What questions should a mobile app survey ask?","a":"What people use the app for, how easy that is, what goes wrong, and what they'd change. A recommendation score gives you a number to track between releases."},{"q":"When is the best time to ask for app feedback?","a":"Right after someone finishes a task in the app, while it's fresh. Avoid interrupting them halfway through something."},{"q":"How do I get useful bug reports from users?","a":"Ask what they were doing just before the problem. This survey only asks that of people who reported a problem, so everyone else skips it."},{"q":"Can I embed this survey in my app?","a":"You can share it as a link, which opens in the phone's browser or an in-app web view, or embed it on a website."}]},"doc":{"schemaVersion":10,"title":"Mobile app survey","description":"Learn how people use your app, where it frustrates them and what would make it more useful.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_mobileap00","ref":"welcome","title":"Hi! A few quick questions about the app. Your answers go straight to the people who build it.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_mobileap01","ref":"platform","title":"Which phone do you use the app on?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_iphone","label":"iPhone","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_android","label":"Android","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_both","label":"Both","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_mobileap02","ref":"frequency","title":"How often do you open the app?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_every_day","label":"Every day","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_a_few_times","label":"A few times a week","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_about_once_a","label":"About once a week","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_less_often_than","label":"Less often than that","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_mobileap03","ref":"main_task","title":"What's the main thing you open the app to do?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":200},{"id":"blk_mobileap04","ref":"task_ease","title":"How easy is it to get that done?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"opinion_scale","steps":5,"startAt":1,"labelLow":"Very hard","labelHigh":"Very easy"},{"id":"blk_mobileap05","ref":"stuck_point","title":"Where do you get stuck or slowed down?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_mobileap06","ref":"problems","title":"Have you run into any of these in the last month?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"multi_select","options":[{"id":"opt_crashes_or_freezes","label":"Crashes or freezes","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_slow_loading","label":"Slow loading","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_trouble_logging_in","label":"Trouble logging in","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_notifications_not_arriving","label":"Notifications not arriving","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_heavy_battery_or","label":"Heavy battery or data use","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_something_not_saving","label":"Something not saving","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_none_of_these","label":"None of these","image_key":null}],"minSelections":1,"maxSelections":7,"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_mobileap07","ref":"problem_detail","title":"Tell us about the last time that happened. What were you doing just before?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":1000,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_mobileap08","ref":"aspects","title":"How would you rate each of these?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"matrix","rows":[{"id":"opt_row_finding_your","label":"Finding your way around"},{"id":"opt_row_speed","label":"Speed"},{"id":"opt_row_how_it","label":"How it looks"},{"id":"opt_row_notifications","label":"Notifications"}],"columns":[{"id":"opt_col_poor","label":"Poor"},{"id":"opt_col_okay","label":"Okay"},{"id":"opt_col_good","label":"Good"},{"id":"opt_col_great","label":"Great"}],"multiplePerRow":false},{"id":"blk_mobileap09","ref":"wish","title":"What one change would make the app more useful to you?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":